            "__typename": "TemplateBlogPostRecord",
            "id": "XqCKJXUyQiKLcY--7jCVEA",
            "internalName": "NeoVim made me fall in love with tech (again)",
            "title": "NeoVim Made Me Fall in Love With Tech ",
            "publishDate": "2024-05-12",
            "slug": "how-neovim-made-me-fall-in-love-with-tech-again",
            "featuredImage": {
              "__typename": "FileField",
              "id": "Gp8szgQgTRCLiTIm5CGw2g",
              "alt": "neovim logo floating over a terminal window showing neovim",
              "blurhash": "LkIP3dWH^,t1x[f$jajJ~XobR$oN",
              "height": 1080,
              "width": 1342,
              "url": "https://www.datocms-assets.com/85391/1715536170-untitled-design-edited.png"
            },
            "excerpt": "NeoVim is more than just another evolution of Vi. It's a philosophy that technology should adapt to the user, not the other way around. This served as a reminder of what initially made me fall in love with tech. With the right tools, we can not only recover lost passion but also push our boundaries and redefine what’s possible.\n",
            "minutesToRead": 8
          },
          {
