  {
    "__typename": "TemplatePageRecord",
    "id": "135975886",
    "slug": "about",
    "components": [
      {
        "__typename": "FeatureHighlightRecord",
        "id": "138277568",
        "heading": "More than just an engineer",
        "eyebrow": "",
        "body": "From my humble beginnings to standing on mountains and everything in between. I am always trying to live to my fullest and show passion in everything I do.&#x20;\n\n> Here are a couple of snippets of my life to help paint a better picture of just who I am.\n",
        "cards": [
          {
            "__typename": "FeatureHighlightCardRecord",
            "id": "138277569",
            "heading": "Started with living in a van",
            "body": "&#x20;I started a blog to document my journey of traveling in a van and rock climbing. It was the creation of this blog that ignited my passion for the web and pushed me to end a 13+ year career with the Navy to follow my dreams.\n",
            "image": {
              "__typename": "FileField",
              "id": "50553431",
              "alt": null,
              "blurhash": "LWMQ-Rt7~q%Mj[ayofof_3of?bof",
              "height": 1201,
              "width": 1201,
              "url": "https://www.datocms-assets.com/85391/1681696294-aac.png"
            }
          },
          {
            "__typename": "FeatureHighlightCardRecord",
            "id": "138277571",
            "heading": "Problem solving on the wall 🧗🏼",
            "body": "As I mentioned previously, rock climbing has been a major part of my life. The art of climbing a mountain is the perfect combination of **preparation, dedication, and critical problem-solving**.\n",
            "image": {
              "__typename": "FileField",
              "id": "50553452",
              "alt": "Justin Wallace rock climbing in Red Rock Nevanda",
              "blurhash": "LtQJAjtm?wxaxDV@kWtS?cr=MxX8",
              "height": 710,
              "width": 639,
              "url": "https://www.datocms-assets.com/85391/1687393191-climbing-1.png"
            }
          },
          {
            "__typename": "FeatureHighlightCardRecord",
            "id": "138277572",
            "heading": "From mountains to the sea",
            "body": "Surfing was the primary reason that I moved to San Diego in 2010 and though I don't paddle out as much as I would like to, (I live 8 miles from the beach now 😱) it still has a strong hold over me.\n\n<p></p>\n",
            "image": {
              "__typename": "FileField",
              "id": "50557283",
              "alt": null,
              "blurhash": "LoM%+iR*_M%f?ajZbvtR~qxaRjoz",
              "height": 811,
              "width": 700,
              "url": "https://www.datocms-assets.com/85391/1687393264-surfing-1.png"
            }
          },
          {
            "__typename": "FeatureHighlightCardRecord",
            "id": "138277573",
            "heading": "Just being kinda goofy",
            "body": "Life is more than just writing code and extreme sports. You need to know when to take it easy and **just be a little goofy**! I love to smile and I love to make others smile. 🫶\n",
            "image": {
              "__typename": "FileField",
              "id": "50578946",
              "alt": null,
              "blurhash": "LoPGv;_2?aMytSoIoJWC~qIoIoo#",
              "height": 618,
              "width": 700,
              "url": "https://www.datocms-assets.com/85391/1687393340-surfing-2.png"
            }
          },
          {
            "__typename": "FeatureHighlightCardRecord",
            "id": "138277575",
            "heading": "Husband and dog dad",
            "body": "Last and <em>far from least </em>I am the husband to an extremely amazing, motivating partner and father to the world's cutest little nugget.<em> Lauren and Achilles are the rocks in my life</em>. **They are perfect**.\n",
            "image": {
              "__typename": "FileField",
              "id": "50577505",
              "alt": null,
              "blurhash": "LpL|=e-;_3Rk?bWBRjV[~qR*bHs:",
              "height": 904,
              "width": 674,
              "url": "https://www.datocms-assets.com/85391/1681701894-husband.png"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
